{"extract":"聖母領報，在古老教曆中又称聖子降孕瞻禮、救贖之始節、基督成胎節，聖公宗称童貞女馬利亞聞報，其他新教稱天使報喜，在基督教，指天使加百列（嘉俾額爾天使）向聖母瑪利亞告知她将受聖神降孕而誕下聖子耶穌。\n","originalImage":"https://upload.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/thumb/f/f7/%28Venice%29_Annunciation_by_Giambattista_Pittoni_-_Gallerie_Accademia.jpg/3840px-%28Venice%29_Annunciation_by_Giambattista_Pittoni_-_Gallerie_Accademia.jpg?utm_source=zh.wikipedia.org&utm_campaign=api&utm_content=thumbnail"}